 s-17-oct-2026\n\nThis installment of the public art project connects the 
 Ortega Branch Library with the narratives of incarcerated women. Choreogr
 aphed by Jo Kreiter\, the performance features vertical dance on an aeria
 l tripod to uplift struggles for commutation and legislative justice. The
  program includes two shows at 1:00 PM and 3:15 PM\, separated by a 2:00 
 PM justice circle hosted alongside Empowerment Avenue 
